the value of million for value a value V is a value input N if
    N = V * 1000000.

the value of billion for value a value is a value input V if
    the value of million for value the value is a value input N
    and V = N * 1000.

the value of trillion for value a value is a value input V if
    the value of billion for value the value is a value input N
    and V = N * 1000.

the value of performance period years is 10.

the value of required market cap for tranche for tranche number a tranche number is a value if
    the tranche number is equal to 1
    and the value of trillion for value 2 is the value.

the value of required market cap for tranche for tranche number a tranche number T is a value V if
    it is not the case that T is equal to 1
    and T >= 2
    and T <= 10
    and the value of trillion for value 2 is a value input N
    and a thing M = T - 1
    and the value of billion for value 500 is a value input K
    and a thing P = M * K
    and V = N + P.

the value of required market cap for tranche for tranche number a tranche number T is a value if
    it is not the case that T is equal to 1
    and T < 2
    and T is equal to 11
    and the value of trillion for value 7.5 is the value.

the value of required market cap for tranche for tranche number a tranche number T is a value if
    it is not the case that T is equal to 1
    and T < 2
    and it is not the case that T is equal to 11
    and T is equal to 12
    and the value of trillion for value 8.5 is the value.

the value of required market cap for tranche for tranche number a tranche number T is 0 if
    it is not the case that T is equal to 1
    and T < 2
    and it is not the case that T is equal to 11
    and it is not the case that T is equal to 12.

the value of required market cap for tranche for tranche number a tranche number T is a value if
    it is not the case that T is equal to 1
    and T > 10
    and T is equal to 11
    and the value of trillion for value 7.5 is the value.

the value of required market cap for tranche for tranche number a tranche number T is a value if
    it is not the case that T is equal to 1
    and T > 10
    and it is not the case that T is equal to 11
    and T is equal to 12
    and the value of trillion for value 8.5 is the value.

the value of required market cap for tranche for tranche number a tranche number T is 0 if
    it is not the case that T is equal to 1
    and T > 10
    and it is not the case that T is equal to 11
    and it is not the case that T is equal to 12.

an obligation can start on day a day if
    something happens on day the day.

